     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">Hi D-RUGgies!\r\n<div>The message I&#39;m forwarding here lists the workshops that will be taught in Datalab this quarter. We&#39;re teaching about databases! We&#39;re teaching about machine learning! We&#39;re teaching about language models! We&#39;re teaching about models for categorical data!\r\n The workshops begin this Thursday with the first session about databases.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Registration is free. Please join us!<br>\r\n<div>-Wes</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>Begin forwarded message:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>From: </b></span><span>Pamela L Reynolds &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">plrey...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>Subject: </b></span><span><b>[datascience-announce] Workshop on Databases this Thursday + DataLab&#39;s Spring Workshop Lineup</b><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>Date: </b></span><span>April 8, 2024 at 5:24:01 PM PDT<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>To: </b></span><span>datascience-announce Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">datascienc...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;, dsifacultyaffiliates Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dsifaculty...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Dear data science community,</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">DataLab’s spring training lineup begin this Thursday (4/11) from 10 AM – 12 PM with a workshop on</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/workshop-overview-of-databases-and-data-storage/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/workshop-overview-of-databases-and-data-storage/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464614959000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0uDvXEROmLh5vlnIkZtzB7\">Overview\r\n of Databases and Data Storage</a></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://reservations.library.ucdavis.edu/event/12295620\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://reservations.library.ucdavis.edu/event/12295620&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464614959000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LVWia_r11EQABqyQ-EF_n\">Register now</a><span> </span>to\r\n join us in our classroom (Shields Library room 360), or to watch the broadcast on Zoom.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Check out the other upcoming trainings and events on our<span> </span><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464614959000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JgI1vomMUVSGz-t5tvtEG\">calendar</a><span> </span>and\r\n in the flyer, attached.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Got questions? We’re available via Zoom on Mondays and in person on Tuesdays from 1 – 2 PM for weekly<span> </span><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/office-hours/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/office-hours/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464614959000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EyDV34Dne-kjFeJsJqS7F\">office\r\n hours.</a><span> </span>Advance signup required.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Happy spring,</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">~Pamela</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">-- </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Pamela L. Reynolds, PhD</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Associate Director</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">UC Davis DataLab: Data Science and Informatics</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">plrey...@ucdavis.edu</span></a></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464614959000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YSahQrGW1cWaWwuFCu3va\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu</span></a></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
